istinct personalities. They will tell you their sorrowful pasts.<br>When their wishes are fulfilled, the <strong>price</strong>\u00a0will come as promised.<br>Is this truly a blessing from the <strong>gods</strong>, or a trick of <strong>fate</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can human willpower go, for <strong>important people</strong>, for <strong>freedom</strong>, for <strong>belief</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game of wishes and punishment,<br>you, how will you decide?</strong><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Gameplay includes <strong>cards</strong>, <strong>platform</strong>, <strong>click-based interactions</strong>, and <strong>chase sequences</strong>.<br>As a divine messenger, the player will use card mechanics in the <strong>Prayer Room</strong>\u00a0to help NPCs fulfill their wishes.<br>Players must judge the correct option based on the shapes on the cards and the text prompts<br>choosing the true desire of the wishers and the price they must pay, in order to successfully complete the transaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the chase levels, you will navigate through the <strong>Ether Land</strong>, filled with bizarre buildings that reflect the wishes of the characters.<br>Be careful not to be caught by other divine messengers, and protect yourself from their attacks while countering them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all the deals are perfectly concluded, the truth will slowly come to light.<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\